# Ruler rows

From Clew's demo vault, Guide/Tabbing.md: a `|kill` row sets the stops from
each column's widest entry and is not shown.

```tabbing
Alice $\qquad$ |= 12 Oak Street $\qquad$ |= |kill
Name:       |> Street:          |> Phone
Alice       |> 12 Oak Street    |> 555 1234
Bob         |> 7 Elm Road       |> 555 9876
```

```tabbing
Wednesday:   |= 10:00–11:00   |= Lecture hall |kill
Mon          |> 9:00          |> Seminar
Tue          |> 14:00         |> Lab
```
